<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
	<meta charset="utf-8" />
	<title>User Created</title>
	<style>
		:root {
			--bg: #121212; --fg: #e8e8e8; --card: #1e1e1e; --link: #8ab4f8;
		}
		@media (prefers-color-scheme: light) {
			:root { --bg: #fff; --fg: #222; --card: #f4f4f4; --link: #0645ad; }
		}
		body { font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; max-width: 480px; margin: 60px auto; color: var(--fg); background: var(--bg); }
		a { color: var(--link); }
		.secret { font-family: monospace; background: var(--card); color: var(--fg); padding: 8px; word-break: break-all; }
		img { display: block; margin: 12px 0; }
	</style>
</head>
<body>
	<h1>User "<%= username %>" created</h1>
	<p>Have them scan this QR code with an authenticator app now — it will not be shown again.</p>
	<img src="<%= qr %>" alt="TOTP QR code" width="200" height="200" />
	<p>Or enter this secret manually: <span class="secret"><%= secret %></span></p>
	<p><a href="/users">Done, back to users</a></p>
</body>
</html>
